  },
  {
   "text": "1. ALL DIMENSIONS IN mm. SHEET A3, SCALE 2:1. x = 0 AT FORWARD FACE, FLOW LEFT TO RIGHT.",
   "kind": "note"
  },
  {
   "text": "2. COUNTER-ROTATING RADIAL-RADIAL SWIRL CUP: 8 PRIMARY PASSAGES (CCW), 10 SECONDARY PASSAGES (CW),",
   "kind": "note"
  },
  {
   "text": "VENTURI AND FLARE; REFERENCE DIAMETER D0 = 27. CONFIGURATION AFTER WANG ET AL., J. FLUID MECH. 583 (2007).",
   "kind": "note"
  },
  {
   "text": "3. ONLY THE PASSAGE COUNTS, SWIRL SENSES AND D0 ARE FROM THE PAPER. ALL OTHER DIMENSIONS ARE CHOSEN HERE.",
   "kind": "note"
  },
  {
   "text": "THE PAPER'S ELLIPTICAL PRIMARY JETS ARE REPLACED BY STRAIGHT RECTANGULAR SLOTS (SKETCH + EXTRUDE-CUT).",
   "kind": "note"
  },
  {
   "text": "4. SLOT CENTRELINE OFFSET FROM AXIS: PRIMARY 8, SECONDARY 11. FLOW AREAS: PRIMARY 160 mm2, SECONDARY 240 mm2",
   "kind": "note"
  },
  {
   "text": "(SPLIT 40/60); VENTURI THROAT 154 mm2.",
   "kind": "note"
  },
  {
   "text": "5. FUEL NOZZLE BORE Ø10. VENTURI: INLET Ø24, THROAT Ø14 x 2 LONG, EXIT Ø17, LIP Ø19 AT x = 21.",
   "kind": "note"
  },
  {
   "text": "6. MODELLING: (a) REVOLVE HALF PROFILE 360°; (b) CUT 8 PRIMARY SLOTS x = 3..8; (c) CUT 10 SECONDARY SLOTS x = 10..16.",
   "kind": "note"
  },
  {
   "text": "7. GENERIC RESEARCH GEOMETRY - NOT AN ENGINE PART DRAWING.",
   "kind": "note"
  }
